doc:sec-7-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7(3) Provision of financial assistance to constitutional corporations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Creative Australia may provide financial assistance in the performance of its functions to a constitutional corporation only if the corporation has applied to Creative Australia for the assistance under subsection (1).   Preliminary  Part 1  Section 7 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 Terms and conditions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer .

concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-7-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7(4) Provision of financial assistance to constitutional corporations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-7-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If Creative Australia decides to provide financial assistance to a constitutional corporation: (a) the terms and conditions on which the assistance is to be provided must be set out in a written agreement between Creative Australia and the corporation; and (b) the corporation must comply with the terms and conditions." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If Creative Australia decides to provide financial assistance to a constitutional corporation: (a) the terms and conditions on which the assistance is to be provided must be set out in a written agreement between Creative Australia and the corporation; and (b) the corporation must comply with the terms and conditions."@en ;
