concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-7-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7(5) Provision of financial assistance to constitutional corporations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-7-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Without limiting subsection (4), the terms and conditions must provide for the circumstances in which the corporation must repay amounts of financial assistance or any other amounts to Creative Australia." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Without limiting subsection (4), the terms and conditions must provide for the circumstances in which the corporation must repay amounts of financial assistance or any other amounts to Creative Australia."@en ;
