concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-7-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7(6) Provision of financial assistance to constitutional corporations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-7-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) An amount payable to Creative Australia under the agreement: (a) is a debt due to Creative Australia; and (b) may be recovered by Creative Australia in a court of competent jurisdiction." ;
    skos:definition "(6) An amount payable to Creative Australia under the agreement: (a) is a debt due to Creative Australia; and (b) may be recovered by Creative Australia in a court of competent jurisdiction."@en ;
