concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17 Creative Workplaces"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-17 ;
    values:originalText "(1) There is to be a part of Creative Australia known as Creative Workplaces. (2) Creative Workplaces is responsible for: (a) promoting fair, safe and respectful workplaces for: (i) Australian artists; and (ii) persons who are employed, or otherwise engaged, by organisations that engage in, or support, Australian arts practice; and (iii) persons otherwise involved in Australian arts practice; and" ;
    skos:definition "(1) There is to be a part of Creative Australia known as Creative Workplaces. (2) Creative Workplaces is responsible for: (a) promoting fair, safe and respectful workplaces for: (i) Australian artists; and (ii) persons who are employed, or otherwise engaged, by organisations that engage in, or support, Australian arts practice; and (iii) persons otherwise involved in Australian arts practice; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1c727e3d8422bd720e584da771a14a5814313437730d3448ed7bd9c43bc950d3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "23"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-17-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-17-ss-2 ;
