concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-18 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18 Simplified outline of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-18 ;
    values:originalText "This Part establishes the Australia Council Board. The Board is responsible for ensuring the proper and efficient performance of Creative Australia’s functions. The Board consists of the Chair, the Deputy Chair, the CEO and up to 11 other members. The Minister appoints the members of the Board other than the CEO. The Minister must consult the Chair before appointing a member other than the Chair. This Part also deals with the terms and conditions of appointment for appointed Board members and the meetings of the Board." ;
    skos:definition "This Part establishes the Australia Council Board. The Board is responsible for ensuring the proper and efficient performance of Creative Australia’s functions. The Board consists of the Chair, the Deputy Chair, the CEO and up to 11 other members. The Minister appoints the members of the Board other than the CEO. The Minister must consult the Chair before appointing a member other than the Chair. This Part also deals with the terms and conditions of appointment for appointed Board members and the meetings of the Board."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c4be2b06a4ba7050631d50a131fabb8ac59767eddcc2de0e9b6144ec87344491" ;
    cof:pageNumber "25"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Minister must consult the Chair before appointing a member other than the Chair." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
