concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-25 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25 Leave"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-25 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may grant the Chair leave of absence on the terms and conditions that the Minister determines. (2) The Chair may grant leave of absence to any other appointed Board member on the terms and conditions that the Chair determines. (3) The Chair must notify the Minister if the Chair grants an appointed Board member leave of absence for a period that exceeds 6 months." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may grant the Chair leave of absence on the terms and conditions that the Minister determines. (2) The Chair may grant leave of absence to any other appointed Board member on the terms and conditions that the Chair determines. (3) The Chair must notify the Minister if the Chair grants an appointed Board member leave of absence for a period that exceeds 6 months."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f4cc7aeb92eee7330890f9e861ff61b3622f60f5729ca415d099c21bc2c5a66d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
