concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-31 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31 Presiding at meetings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-31 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Chair must preside at all meetings of the Board at which the Chair is present.   The Australia Council Board  Part 3 Procedures of the Board  Division 4 Section 32 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 (2) If the Chair is not present at a meeting of the Board, the Deputy Chair, if present, must preside at the meeting. (3) If neither the Chair nor the Deputy Chair is present at a meeting of the Board, the other appointed Board members present must appoint one of themselves to preside." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Chair must preside at all meetings of the Board at which the Chair is present.   The Australia Council Board  Part 3 Procedures of the Board  Division 4 Section 32 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 (2) If the Chair is not present at a meeting of the Board, the Deputy Chair, if present, must preside at the meeting. (3) If neither the Chair nor the Deputy Chair is present at a meeting of the Board, the other appointed Board members present must appoint one of themselves to preside."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "64e8f97038076cd836d92f686233ada61814aca9cd76d0914c25c7327c7e7d69" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-31-ss-1 ;
