concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-35g-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35G(5) Appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-35g-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A First Nations Board member holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 4 years. Note: A First Nations Board member may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A First Nations Board member holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 4 years. Note: A First Nations Board member may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
