concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-35k a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35K Leave"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-35k ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may grant a Co-Chair of the First Nations Board leave of absence on the terms and conditions that the Minister determines. (2) The Co-Chairs of the First Nations Board may grant leave of absence to any other First Nations Board member on the terms and conditions that the Co-Chairs determine. (3) The Co-Chairs of the First Nations Board must notify the Minister if the Co-Chairs grant a First Nations Board member leave of absence for a period that exceeds 6 months." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may grant a Co-Chair of the First Nations Board leave of absence on the terms and conditions that the Minister determines. (2) The Co-Chairs of the First Nations Board may grant leave of absence to any other First Nations Board member on the terms and conditions that the Co-Chairs determine. (3) The Co-Chairs of the First Nations Board must notify the Minister if the Co-Chairs grant a First Nations Board member leave of absence for a period that exceeds 6 months."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ee6d3000a4c4eab973c9e97f3d43591f89b506e0177ceb02fd5de6247cf117e6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-35k-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-35k-ss-2 ;
