concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-35l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35L Resignation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-35l ;
    values:originalText "(1) A First Nations Board member may resign the member’s appointment by giving the Minister a written resignation. (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Minister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A First Nations Board member may resign the member’s appointment by giving the Minister a written resignation. (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Minister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day."@en ;
