doc:sec-39 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "39 Membership" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Music Australia Council consists of: (a) the Chair of the Music Australia Council; and (b) 8 other members. (2) The Chair of the Music Australia Council must be the CEO. Note: The CEO may delegate this function (see section 84A).   Music Australia Council  Part 4 Establishment etc. of Music Australia Council  Division 2 Section 39 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 (3) For the purposes of the finance law, an appointed Music Australia Council member is an official of Creative Australia." ;
    cof:pageNumber "44"^^xsd:integer .

