concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-47d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47D Membership"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-47d ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Writing Australia Council consists of: (a) the Chair of the Writing Australia Council; and (b) 8 other members. (2) The Chair of the Writing Australia Council must be the CEO. Note: The CEO may delegate this function (see section 84A).   Writing Australia Council  Part 4A Establishment etc. of Writing Australia Council  Division 2 Section 47D Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 (3) For the purposes of the finance law, an appointed Writing Australia Council member is an official of Creative Australia." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Writing Australia Council consists of: (a) the Chair of the Writing Australia Council; and (b) 8 other members. (2) The Chair of the Writing Australia Council must be the CEO. Note: The CEO may delegate this function (see section 84A).   Writing Australia Council  Part 4A Establishment etc. of Writing Australia Council  Division 2 Section 47D Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 (3) For the purposes of the finance law, an appointed Writing Australia Council member is an official of Creative Australia."@en ;
