concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-47e-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47E(5) Appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-47e-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) An appointed Writing Australia Council member holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 4 years. Note: An appointed Writing Australia Council member may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "(5) An appointed Writing Australia Council member holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 4 years. Note: An appointed Writing Australia Council member may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
