concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-47m a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47M Procedures"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-47m ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Writing Australia Council may, subject to any direction given under subsection (2), determine its own procedures. (2) The Board may give the Writing Australia Council written directions about the Council’s procedures. (3) A direction given under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.   Creative Workplaces Council  Part 5 Introduction  Division 1 Section 48 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Writing Australia Council may, subject to any direction given under subsection (2), determine its own procedures. (2) The Board may give the Writing Australia Council written directions about the Council’s procedures. (3) A direction given under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.   Creative Workplaces Council  Part 5 Introduction  Division 1 Section 48 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c61cf4504b660c1a5bc3e007e42f9e576e97ed4da6c1c6bd9ca247d76d5c91c1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-47m-ss-1 ;
