doc:sec-51 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "51 Membership" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Creative Workplaces Council consists of: (a) the Chair of the Creative Workplaces Council; and (b) 6 other members. (2) For the purposes of the finance law, a Creative Workplaces Council member is an official of Creative Australia.   Creative Workplaces Council  Part 5 Appointment etc. of Creative Workplaces Council members  Division 3 Section 52 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025" ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer .

