    cof:title "52(6) Appointment" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) A Creative Workplaces Council member holds office for the period specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must not exceed 4 years. Note: A Creative Workplaces Council member may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
