concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-54 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54 Remuneration"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-54 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A Creative Workplaces Council member is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If   Creative Workplaces Council  Part 5 Appointment etc. of Creative Workplaces Council members  Division 3 Section 55 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the member is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the rules. (2) A Creative Workplaces Council member is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the rules. (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A Creative Workplaces Council member is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If   Creative Workplaces Council  Part 5 Appointment etc. of Creative Workplaces Council members  Division 3 Section 55 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the member is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the rules. (2) A Creative Workplaces Council member is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the rules. (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973."@en ;
