concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-68 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "68 Other paid work"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-68 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The CEO must not engage in paid work outside the duties of the CEO’s office without the Chair’s approval. (2) The Chair must notify the Minister of any approval given under subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The CEO must not engage in paid work outside the duties of the CEO’s office without the Chair’s approval. (2) The Chair must notify the Minister of any approval given under subsection (1)."@en ;
