concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-69 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "69 Remuneration"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-69 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The CEO is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the CEO is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the rules. (2) The CEO is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the rules.   CEO, staff and consultants  Part 7 Chief Executive Officer  Division 2 Section 70 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The CEO is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the CEO is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the rules. (2) The CEO is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the rules.   CEO, staff and consultants  Part 7 Chief Executive Officer  Division 2 Section 70 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025 (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4e84691f31d5a4f9a60c3456d5a44291a25ffd9adbd83f3f666c3c95403b4b47" ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer ;
