concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-71 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "71 Resignation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-71 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The CEO may resign the CEO’s appointment by giving the Chair a written resignation. (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Chair or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day. (3) If the CEO resigns under this section, the Chair must notify the Minister of the resignation." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The CEO may resign the CEO’s appointment by giving the Chair a written resignation. (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Chair or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day. (3) If the CEO resigns under this section, the Chair must notify the Minister of the resignation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b4e76a7ac470ddde74ea836da8248812b9dd5fdd635434d7e35b5fd6d98bf4e5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "71"^^xsd:integer ;
