concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-74 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "74 Staff"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-74 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Creative Australia may employ such persons as it considers necessary for the performance of its functions and the exercise of its powers. (2) An employee is to be employed on the terms and conditions that Creative Australia determines in writing." ;
