concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-80 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80 Restrictions on financial transactions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-80 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Creative Australia must not, without the written approval of the Minister: (a) acquire any property, right or privilege for a consideration exceeding in amount or value the amount mentioned in subsection (2); or (b) dispose of any property, right or privilege if the amount or value of the consideration for the disposal, or the value of the property, right or privilege, exceeds the amount mentioned in subsection (2); or (c) enter into a contract for the construction of a building for Creative Australia, being a contract under which Creative Australia is to pay an amount exceeding the amount mentioned in subsection (2); or (d) enter into a lease of land for a period exceeding 10 years. (2) For the purposes of paragraphs (1)(a), (b) and (c), the amount is: (a) $5 million; or (b) if the rules prescribe a different amount—that prescribed amount." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Creative Australia must not, without the written approval of the Minister: (a) acquire any property, right or privilege for a consideration exceeding in amount or value the amount mentioned in subsection (2); or (b) dispose of any property, right or privilege if the amount or value of the consideration for the disposal, or the value of the property, right or privilege, exceeds the amount mentioned in subsection (2); or (c) enter into a contract for the construction of a building for Creative Australia, being a contract under which Creative Australia is to pay an amount exceeding the amount mentioned in subsection (2); or (d) enter into a lease of land for a period exceeding 10 years. (2) For the purposes of paragraphs (1)(a), (b) and (c), the amount is: (a) $5 million; or (b) if the rules prescribe a different amount—that prescribed amount."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "13e1a0e5eb18684f44d1968c38fe23d59e5119bb83fa6633c8645024e9737c01" ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-80-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-80-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
