concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-82 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "82 Taxation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-82 ;
    values:originalText "Creative Australia is not subject to taxation under any law of the Commonwealth or of a State or Territory. Note: Despite this section, Creative Australia may be subject to taxation under certain laws (see, for example, section 177-5 of the A New Tax System (Goods and Services Tax) Act 1999 and section 66 of the Fringe Benefits Tax Assessment Act 1986).   Other matters  Part 9  Section 83 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025" ;
    skos:definition "Creative Australia is not subject to taxation under any law of the Commonwealth or of a State or Territory. Note: Despite this section, Creative Australia may be subject to taxation under certain laws (see, for example, section 177-5 of the A New Tax System (Goods and Services Tax) Act 1999 and section 66 of the Fringe Benefits Tax Assessment Act 1986).   Other matters  Part 9  Section 83 Creative Australia Act 2023 Compilation date: 01/07/2025"@en ;
