concept:creative-australia-act-2023-sec-84a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "84A Delegation by the CEO"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-84a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The CEO may, in writing, delegate the CEO’s functions under subsection 39(2) or 47D(2) to: (a) an employee of Creative Australia who holds, or is acting in, the position of director or an equivalent higher position; or (b) a Board member. Note: Sections 34AA to 34A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 contain provisions relating to delegations. (2) In performing a function, or exercising a power, delegated under subsection (1), the delegate must comply with any directions of the CEO." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The CEO may, in writing, delegate the CEO’s functions under subsection 39(2) or 47D(2) to: (a) an employee of Creative Australia who holds, or is acting in, the position of director or an equivalent higher position; or (b) a Board member. Note: Sections 34AA to 34A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 contain provisions relating to delegations. (2) In performing a function, or exercising a power, delegated under subsection (1), the delegate must comply with any directions of the CEO."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3817a851148540773035dbc4a054c9879c4ce2bc94ba64a50bff44177c3f9d63" ;
    cof:pageNumber "77"^^xsd:integer ;
